 "description": "Updates details of a tracked job (notes, deadline, salary, tags).\n\n**Input:**\n- `tracked_job_id`: The tracked job ID \u2014 `trackedJobs[].id` from tracker_list output, distinct from `trackable.id` and `job.id` (required)\n- `notes`: Updated notes\n- `deadline`: Deadline date (ISO 8601 format)\n- `salary_offered`: Salary amount\n- `salary_offered_type`: Salary type: year, month, week, day, hour\n- `tags`: Comma-separated tags (e.g., \"remote,startup,tech\")\n- `reminder_at`: Reminder date/time in ISO 8601 format, e.g. \"2025-03-15T10:00:00Z\" (must be in the future, or empty to clear)\n\n**Output:**\nReturns the updated tracked job.\n",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "deadline": {
    "description": "Deadline date in ISO 8601 format",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "notes": {
    "description": "Notes about this job",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "reminder_at": {
    "description": "ISO 8601 datetime, e.g. \"2025-03-15T10:00:00Z\" (must be in the future, or empty to clear)",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "salary_offered": {
    "description": "Salary amount",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "salary_offered_type": {
    "description": "Salary type: year, month, week, day, hour",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "tags": {
    "description": "Comma-separated tags (e.g., \"remote,startup,tech\")",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "tracked_job_id": {
    "description": "The tracked job ID \u2014 `trackedJobs[].id` from tracker_list output, distinct from `trackable.id` and `job.id` (required)",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "tracked_job_id"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
